/// defaults to [`Unit::Nanosecond`]), must divide evenly into `86,400`
/// seconds (one 24-hour civil day). For example, increments of both
/// 45 seconds and 15 minutes are allowed, but 7 seconds and 25 minutes are
/// both not allowed.
